lapigo.yaml:6:12: warning: sort key "version" may change after the row is created
   6 |     sort: [-version, -id]
     |            ^^^^^^^^
   a row whose sort value changes can move relative to a live cursor; this is inherent to keyset pagination and does not block generation. Mark `version` `immutable: true` if its value must never change once set (spec §3.3 rule 5)